	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_enemy_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ゆうえんち……
それは　ひとときの　ゆめ……▼
すなわち　ひとびとの
りそうの　かたち……▼
りそうなど　いらぬわ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-07T11:00:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-07T11:00:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチクマン『遊園地……
それは　ひと時の　夢……▼
すなわち　人々の　理想の形……
▼
理想など　破壊してくれる……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-07T11:00:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-07T11:00:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_enemy_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ファファファ！
おわりだ！　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ファファファ！
終わりだ！　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]ガール！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_enemy_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ゆけ！　わが　ポケモン！
このゆうえんちで　あばれるのだ！▼
すべてを　はかい　してやれっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチクマン『ゆけ！　我が　ポケモン！
この遊園地で　暴れるのだ！▼
すべてを　破壊　しつくせっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_hero_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『まちなさい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『待ちなさい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
